+/* ---- patch 0169 (A9e): DSP memory bursts. Stock wm_adsp_load / wm_adsp_load_coeff write a whole region with ONE regmap_raw_write (AMP
+ * wm_adsp.c:1987-2002, :2722-2738) and read the algorithm list with one regmap_raw_read (:2134-2181): on SPI one chip-select-low transaction,
+ * the address once (bit 31 clear = write, set = read), 2 pad bytes, then the words back to back (regmap-spi, AMP cs35l41-spi.c:33-46: 32-bit
+ * big-endian registers, stride 4, pad 16 bits). Here the same bytes go out with the chip select held low across FIFO fills of <= AMP_FILL_MAX
+ * bytes (the read path of amp_read already holds CS across two transfers); every fill is armed (on = 3 / 4) and its bytes checked by w32. ---- */
